   "title": "gmlx nodes: install",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "These gmlx nodes run the image model on a gmlx server on your Mac (Apple Silicon, M3 or newer). Flux2Scheduler gives FLUX.2 klein's schedule for the image size, so keep its width and height those of the latent.\n\n1. Install gmlx: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/installation.html\n2. Put the nodes into ComfyUI, then restart ComfyUI:\n\n   gmlx comfyui install\n\n3. Download the model:\n\n   gmlx pull flux-2-klein\n\nPut reference-1.png and reference-2.png in ComfyUI's input folder, or pick other images in the Reference nodes. The first reference sets the image size.\n\nGuide: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/comfyui.html"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
